# Loon Rule Set - Siri DIRECT + Apple Intelligence US Proxy
# Import as a local rule set in Loon.
# IMPORTANT: Replace 美国节点 with the exact name of your US proxy policy/group.
# Siri / dictation / Apple search: DIRECT
DOMAIN,guzzoni.apple.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,smoot.apple.com,DIRECT

# Apple Intelligence Private Cloud Compute: US proxy
DOMAIN,apple-relay.cloudflare.com,美国节点
DOMAIN,apple-relay.fastly-edge.com,美国节点
DOMAIN,cp4.cloudflare.com,美国节点

